{
    "word": "profligacy",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                "word": "profligacy",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d27cf900-8376-4c67-b690-561951d69815",
                        "entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "profligacies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a32f404b-1d6e-363a-9b8b-55023ea6890e",
                        "entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Careless wastefulness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd9000be-c9cd-412b-846a-635b6c531345",
                                "sense_id": "a32f404b-1d6e-363a-9b8b-55023ea6890e",
                                "text": "No question has arisen within the records of history that pressed with the importance of the present.[…]whether man shall inherit his rights, and universal civilisation take place? Whether the fruits of his labours shall be enjoyed by himself or consumed by the profligacy of governments?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af7c364a-7952-41e9-aee0-6308c7a09483",
                                "sense_id": "a32f404b-1d6e-363a-9b8b-55023ea6890e",
                                "text": "She mixed furniture with the same fatal profligacy as she mixed drinks, and this outrageous contact between things which were intended by Nature to be kept poles apart gave her an inexpressible thrill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2a58660-a5e5-4efa-8475-e86728b5f9d2",
                                "sense_id": "a32f404b-1d6e-363a-9b8b-55023ea6890e",
                                "text": "Villa spent most of the second period probing from wide areas and had a succession of corners but despite their profligacy they will be glad to overturn the 6-0 hammering they suffered at St James' Park in August following former boss Martin O'Neill's departure"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0a016de-4e2d-4d10-80bd-badcfd91a0cc",
                                "sense_id": "a32f404b-1d6e-363a-9b8b-55023ea6890e",
                                "text": "Outsiders who scoffed at this profligacy misunderstood the masquerade. Condé’s editors were the original influencers, their lives a top-to-bottom marketing campaign for the company that hired them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a1c77f7-a2d4-3f99-9570-af442dd7ab30",
                        "entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Shameless and immoral behaviour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37e18636-4e88-4bbb-9c34-910abd443d96",
                                "sense_id": "4a1c77f7-a2d4-3f99-9570-af442dd7ab30",
                                "text": "He had, indeed, reduced several women to a state of utter profligacy, had broke the hearts of some, and had the honour of occasioning the violent death of one poor girl, who had either drowned herself, or, what was rather more probable, had been drowned by him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6a88efa-f5e9-4220-8678-f3139d0e154e",
                                "sense_id": "4a1c77f7-a2d4-3f99-9570-af442dd7ab30",
                                "text": "Sir Robert bitterly reproached himself for having consigned his child to another, when he saw the effect of too early initiation into profligacy, or, as Francis called it, knowledge of the world."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48a65967-ff64-4b90-ba23-bce9e9063e72",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "source_sense_description": "careless wastefulness",
                        "target_lang_word": "verspilling",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "verspilling",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6441da8-b247-33c8-8b94-fc52dd4967f5",
                                        "entry_id": "9c9576e0-e9f2-3077-aaf3-be004a6cb47e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het teloor laten gaan van iets waardevols door nalatigheid"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78bf6956-fed8-4100-afa3-bf71e9816d45",
                                                "sense_id": "a6441da8-b247-33c8-8b94-fc52dd4967f5",
                                                "text": "De verspilling van de natuurlijke hulpbronnen van de aarde is een bron van grote zorg."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c25e7a2-8f31-42bd-b1bd-49ea3b16b719",
                                                "sense_id": "a6441da8-b247-33c8-8b94-fc52dd4967f5",
                                                "text": "Thuis bij oom Hans Olaf, Alice, Ariadne en Sebastian hadden ze jaren geleden alles wat gezien kon worden als verspilling of onmatigheid afgeschaft en eerder een álternatieve kerst'georganiseerd, zoals Ariadne spottend zei."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e907e0f2-d190-4d8d-bd5e-bf0d5b903418",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "source_sense_description": "careless wastefulness",
                        "target_lang_word": "roekeloosheid",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "roekeloosheid",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bacbdc3-140a-322c-8e0a-5d4f6748d675",
                                        "entry_id": "10ee40e3-dd31-3676-b987-950548c4ff1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het roekeloos zijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1791a28a-4bbf-466b-a05a-f96192a57fe6",
                                                "sense_id": "1bacbdc3-140a-322c-8e0a-5d4f6748d675",
                                                "text": "De roekeloosheid van de chauffeur zorgde dat hij een hogere straf van de rechter kreeg."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2db5900d-054f-4f55-9c11-2a058bde5d7b",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb16090c-48c1-3879-95d8-17a8d248e04a",
                        "source_sense_description": "careless wastefulness",
                        "target_lang_word": "Verschwendung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Verschwendung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                        "entry_id": "d2f5cc18-a4b0-3c1a-a312-55527038eebb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unnötiger oder sinnloser Verbrauch von etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "443ceb17-3659-4f62-ab6c-7a120eb67b2c",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "Geiz ist Grausamkeit gegen die Dürftigen und die Verschwendung ist es nicht weniger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba7e0206-ffd4-40bd-b1d2-3106aff2f6a7",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "Wo die Barmherzigkeit und Klugheit ist, da ist nicht Verschwendung noch Täuschung."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54e79c73-1db1-4cbc-a4a9-bd0aa4011e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "Du kannst doch nicht den halben Salat wegwerfen, nur weil er nicht so hübsch gekräuselt ist! Was für eine Verschwendung!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23a7838e-dbe0-4839-af79-415d650d4e50",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "„Die Ausbildung war die reinste Verschwendung von Zeit, Geld und Einsatz gewesen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd8c0ea6-dd19-4219-a1d2-265769de949f",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "„Ich kann nicht behaupten, dass diese Verschwendung meiner Geldmittel mir irgendeine wesentliche Befriedigung verschaffte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca48e427-ee5e-4440-9af9-acd28c338ce5",
                                                "sense_id": "aaa6d95d-972b-37de-8575-60243a6d9dbf",
                                                "text": "„Es herrschte dort der Überfluß, oder vielmehr die Verschwendung, die man in Paris bei allen Leuten dieser Klasse findet: große Gesellschaft, hohes Kartenspiel, prachtvolles Essen und ungezwungene Heiterkeit bei Tisch.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
